ShareVaultRequestRedeemTest
├── when shares is zero
│   └── it should revert
├── when receiver is the zero address
│   └── it should revert
├── given requests are paused
│   └── it should revert
├── given the caller is inside the lockup
│   ├── it should revert
│   └── given the shares were transferred to another account
│       └── it should revert for the new holder too
└── given the lockup has passed
    ├── when the shares exceed the caller balance
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when the shares are within the caller balance
        └── it should escrow the shares in the vault for the current epoch
